{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DumsfrxrqphvLkvKh2gYEb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档下，C1' 域阶梯核心（Wiki=1, C4=2, arXiv=3）成立但 Qwen-cont 边缘性和 θ 依赖性被审稿人重点追问。\n  C3 从 \"K*-aware filtering outperforms\" 降级为 \"binary filtering suffices for web text; graduated filtering \n  provides no incremental benefit, suggesting K* captures discriminability rather than curation-relevant quality \n  differences\"。两个 planned 实验（exp-014, exp-028）提供补充证据但不改变核心叙事。\n  exp-014 的 naturalistic validation 展示 lab-to-wild 迁移存在但偏弱，审稿人认为是 interesting preliminary \n  而非 convincing validation。exp-028 的 power curve 确认 n=5000 足够但暴露 n<3000 时边缘配置不稳定，\n  被用于 rebuttal 中论证现有样本量充足。what_if 的 arXiv negative 整合被一位审稿人认可科学诚实，\n  但另一位用它论证 C3 的 practical value 不足。总体 ARR 3.0-3.5，Findings 概率 0.65-0.85。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic CC Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-09/2026-01 snapshot 各抽 50K 文档，用训练好的 OBD-LightGBM \n      预测 depth distribution，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, \n      hapax legomena ratio)、重复率 (self-BLEU) 做 Spearman correlation。\n      额外分析：按预测 depth 分层后各质量指标的分布变化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_per_snapshot: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0_pct: 62.3\n        depth_1_pct: 24.7\n        depth_2_pct: 8.4\n        depth_3plus_pct: 4.6\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.28\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.22\n      spearman_rho_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.19\n      spearman_rho_hapax_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_selfbleu_vs_predicted_depth: 0.16\n      spearman_rho_selfbleu_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_stratified_alignscore_mean:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.65\n        depth_2: 0.58\n        depth_3plus: 0.51\n      depth_stratified_ttr_mean:\n        depth_0: 0.483\n        depth_1: 0.451\n        depth_2: 0.422\n        depth_3plus: 0.398\n      snapshot_temporal_shift:\n        cc_2025_09_mean_depth: 0.58\n        cc_2026_01_mean_depth: 0.64\n        delta: 0.06\n        p_ks_test: 0.032\n      cross_validation_with_lab_features:\n        feature_rank_spearman_lab_vs_wild: 0.81\n        top3_wild_features: [\"freq_entropy\", \"surp_d1_mean\", \"surp_std\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下，lab-to-wild 迁移部分成功但受限。Spearman ρ~0.22-0.28 统计显著但 practically \n      moderate，原因有三：(1) CC 真实数据包含多种非 prompt-chain 的合成路径（翻译管道、摘要重写、\n      RAG 输出），这些与训练时的 prompt-chain 分布不同；(2) CC 包含大量非英文和低质量原始文本，\n      引入与 depth 无关的噪声；(3) 深度预测在 depth≥2 处 uncertainty 急剧增大（lab 中 2v3 AUC \n      仅 0.55-0.56），导致高 depth 预测噪声大。正向信号来自 depth-stratified quality 单调递减——\n      预测的更深层文本确实质量更低——但效应大小不足以支持 \"operational deployment\" claim。\n      时间维度的 CC 2025→2026 depth 增长（+0.06）与合成文本扩散趋势一致但统计上 borderline。\n      审稿人会认为这是 \"suggestive but not definitive\" 的 preliminary validation，\n      一位审稿人可能要求排除明显的机器翻译文本后重做分析。Feature ranking 在 lab 和 wild 之间 \n      ρ=0.81 说明特征空间迁移合理，但不完美——wild 数据中 freq_entropy 的重要性上升，\n      因为不同合成路径产生不同的词汇分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CC Depth Distribution vs Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Predicted Depth\", \"N docs\", \"AlignScore (mean±std)\", \"TTR (mean±std)\", \"Self-BLEU (mean±std)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"~31K\", \"0.72±0.11\", \"0.483±0.052\", \"0.12±0.04\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"~12K\", \"0.65±0.13\", \"0.451±0.058\", \"0.15±0.05\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"~4K\", \"0.58±0.14\", \"0.422±0.061\", \"0.19±0.06\"]\n          - [\"3+\", \"~2K\", \"0.51±0.16\", \"0.398±0.067\", \"0.23±0.07\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Spearman Correlations (Predicted Depth vs Quality)\"\n        columns: [\"Quality Metric\", \"ρ\", \"p-value\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"AlignScore\", \"-0.28\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.30, -0.26]\"]\n          - [\"Type-Token Ratio\", \"-0.22\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.24, -0.20]\"]\n          - [\"Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.19\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.21, -0.17]\"]\n          - [\"Self-BLEU\", \"+0.16\", \"<0.001\", \"[+0.14, +0.18]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth (x) vs AlignScore (y), with density contours. 清晰但散布大。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: depth-stratified AlignScore/TTR means with error bars,单调递减趋势可见。\"\n      - \"Histogram: CC 2025-09 vs 2026-01 predicted depth distributions overlay,轻微右移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 提供了方向性证据但不是 decisive。核心限制：我们的 depth \n      predictor 训练于 prompt-chain controlled data，而 wild 合成文本的生成路径多样化且未知。\n      ρ~0.25 的 moderate correlation 足以进入 Discussion 作为 \"promising direction\"，\n      但审稿人不会将其视为强 external validity 证据。Median 档审稿人的典型反应：\n      \"The naturalistic analysis is interesting but the modest correlations (ρ<0.30) \n      raise questions about whether the lab-measured K* translates to actionable \n      web-scale data governance\" — 这成为 major weakness #2 但不致命。\n      建议在论文中定位为 \"preliminary naturalistic analysis\" 而非 \"validation\"，\n      并在 Limitations 中讨论 lab-to-wild gap。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      对 C4 数据（使用 exp-007 的 Qwen-cont 和 Pythia 数据），在 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} \n      各做 10 次 bootstrap resample，每次重新计算 1v2 pairwise AUC 和 K* 判定，\n      绘制 power curve：在各 n 下 K*=2 判定的成功率（即 1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60 的比例）。\n    expected_results:\n      models_tested: [\"Qwen-cont (most marginal)\", \"Pythia-1.4B (moderate margin)\"]\n      resamples_per_n: 10\n      qwen_cont_power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.3\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.610\n          mean_ci_width: 0.038\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.591\n        n_2000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.5\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.027\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.597\n        n_3000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.7\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.022\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.600\n        n_4000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.9\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.019\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.602\n        n_5000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.017\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.603\n      pythia_power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.7\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.653\n          mean_ci_width: 0.035\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.636\n        n_2000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.9\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.025\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.641\n        n_3000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.020\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.644\n        n_4000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.018\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.645\n        n_5000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.016\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.646\n      critical_n_for_95pct_power:\n        qwen_cont: 4500\n        pythia: 2000\n      arXiv_implication:\n        arXiv_n_per_model: 2200\n        arXiv_2v3_effect_size: \"larger (AUC~0.63-0.65)\"\n        arXiv_power_sufficient: true\n        note: \"arXiv 的 2v3 AUC 效应量 (0.63-0.65) 远大于 C4 1v2 (0.61)，n=2200 足够\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 power curve 揭示了已知的 Qwen-cont 边缘性问题的样本量根源。\n      Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅超过 θ=0.60 约 0.011，这意味着 CI lower > θ \n      需要很窄的 CI，即大样本。在 n=1000 时 CI width~0.038，CI lower~0.591 < 0.60，\n      导致 K*=2 判定失败率 70%。n=3000 是转折点（成功率 70%），n≥4500 才达到 95% power。\n      相比之下 Pythia 1v2 AUC=0.6539，margin 大得多，n=2000 即可达 90% power。\n      这为审稿人提供了两个信息：(1) 现有 n=5000 的主实验样本量充分（Qwen-cont 100% 通过），\n      (2) Qwen-cont 的边缘性是效应量问题而非方法论缺陷。\n      arXiv 实验 n=2200 但效应量更大（2v3 AUC 0.63-0.65），power 充足。\n      审稿人可能的反应：承认现有样本量 adequate，但指出 \"the marginal Qwen-cont result \n      suggests that for some model configurations, considerably larger samples would \n      be needed to confidently determine K*\"，这成为 minor weakness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"Qwen-cont Success Rate\", \"Qwen-cont mean CI lower\", \"Pythia Success Rate\", \"Pythia mean CI lower\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"3/10\", \"0.591\", \"7/10\", \"0.636\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"5/10\", \"0.597\", \"9/10\", \"0.641\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"7/10\", \"0.600\", \"10/10\", \"0.644\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"9/10\", \"0.602\", \"10/10\", \"0.645\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.603\", \"10/10\", \"0.646\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve: x=sample size, y=K*=2 detection success rate, 两条线 (Qwen-cont, Pythia)，虚线标 95% power 和对应 critical n。\"\n      - \"CI width vs n: 显示 CI 收窄速度，标注 Qwen-cont 在各 n 下 CI lower 相对 θ=0.60 的位置。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Power curve 的核心价值在于 rebuttal。当审稿人质疑 Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 \n      的 marginal 性时，power curve 提供了量化回应：\"At n=5000, even the most marginal \n      configuration (Qwen-cont, AUC=0.611) achieves 100% K*=2 detection rate. \n      The marginality reflects a genuine small effect size for this particular \n      model in continuation mode, not insufficient evidence.\"\n      同时 power curve 暴露了一个 honest limitation：如果有模型的 1v2 AUC 在 0.600-0.605 \n      范围内（比 Qwen-cont 更边缘），n=5000 可能不够。这在 median 档下被审稿人标记为 \n      minor concern 但可以通过 \"our protocol can be scaled to larger n for \n      borderline cases\" 来回应。\n      Rebuttal 用途：直接回应 θ=0.60 任意性质疑——power analysis 表明在合理的 n 下，\n      θ±0.02 范围内的 K* 判定结果一致（AUC 0.58 的 pair 在任何 n 下都不通过，\n      AUC 0.63+ 的 pair 在 n≥1500 下就通过），证明 θ=0.60 处存在 natural gap。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what-if)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 负向结果整合进论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null \n      result 表格，Discussion 增加 \"K* characterizes discriminability not data utility\" 洞察，\n      Appendix 放完整 15-run paired t-test 表。评估对审稿分数和 credibility 的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      section_5_addition:\n        table_rows: 3\n        table_content: \"no_filter/binary/graduated on arXiv, MMLU and HellaSwag means±std\"\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.94\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: 0.89\n        paired_ttest_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.005\n        paired_ttest_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: \"<0.001\"\n        binary_direction_conflict: \"MMLU -0.23pp vs HellaSwag +0.42pp\"\n      discussion_insight:\n        key_sentence: >\n          K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary of recursive \n          generation, not a utility boundary — text at depth 2-3 is distinguishable \n          from depth 3-4 on arXiv (2v3 AUC=0.64), but this discriminability does not \n          translate to meaningful quality differences for downstream training.\n      reviewer_reactions:\n        reviewer_1_positive: >\n          \"The honest reporting of the arXiv null result (exp-026) is appreciated \n          and strengthens the paper's credibility. The reframing of K* as a \n          discriminability measure rather than a utility measure is insightful.\"\n        reviewer_2_negative: >\n          \"The arXiv filtering result essentially means that K*-aware curation only \n          works on C4 with one model family (Qwen). Combined with exp-025 (Pythia \n          null), the practical value of C3 is limited to a narrow setting.\"\n        reviewer_3_neutral: >\n          \"Honest negative results are expected in scientific practice, not bonus \n          points. The C3 claim should be explicitly conditional on model and domain.\"\n      credibility_delta: \"+0.15 to +0.25 on overall score (partial offset by C3 weakening)\"\n      c3_acceptance_prob_impact: \"-0.10 (from 0.55 to 0.45)\"\n      honest_negative_recognition: \"acknowledged by 2/3 reviewers but not viewed as special merit\"\n      net_paper_impact:\n        arr_score_without_integration: 3.15\n        arr_score_with_integration: 3.25\n        findings_prob_without: 0.70\n        findings_prob_with: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下，诚实报告负向结果是双刃剑。正面：(1) 增加科学可信度——审稿人看到作者不\n      cherry-pick 结果；(2) \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察为 K* 概念提供了更深层理解，从 \n      \"K* predicts optimal curation\" 转为更 nuanced 的 \"K* measures statistical \n      discriminability whose practical implications are domain- and model-dependent\"。\n      负面：(1) C3 的 practical claim 从 \"K*-aware filtering outperforms\" 被迫降级为 \n      \"binary filtering suffices for web text; graduated filtering provides no \n      additional benefit\"——这削弱了论文的 practical impact story；(2) 两个负向 filtering \n      结果（exp-025 Pythia, exp-026 arXiv）加上 exp-006 仅 Qwen-C4 正向结果，让审稿人\n      总结为 \"filtering benefit is model-specific and domain-specific\"；(3) 审稿人认为\n      honest negative 是 expected practice 而非加分项——\"we don't give extra credit \n      for not lying\"。\n      净效应在 median 档下是 slightly positive：credibility gain (+0.1-0.15 on score) \n      略大于 practical claim 损失，因为 C1' 是论文核心且不受影响。Findings 概率从 0.70 \n      提升到 0.78，因为 Findings track 更看重 characterization quality 而非 practical impact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: arXiv Filtering Results (Section 5 addition)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\", \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Binary\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.0023 (p=0.005)\", \"+0.0042 (p<0.001)\"]\n          - [\"Graduated α=0.9\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.0001 (p=0.94)\", \"-0.0001 (p=0.89)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"无新图。现有 Section 5 的 filtering comparison figure 增加 arXiv panel。\"\n    analysis: >\n      整合策略：在 Section 5 增加一段 \"Domain Generalization of Filtering\" 小节，\n      先呈 C4 正向结果（binary > graduated ≈ no-filter），再呈 arXiv null result \n      （graduated ≈ no-filter, binary 有 metric-specific trade-off），最后 Pythia \n      null result（所有策略 indistinguishable）。Discussion 中将 C3 重新定位：\n      \"These results reveal that K* characterizes the boundary of statistical \n      discriminability in recursive generations, not a boundary of training data \n      utility. The arXiv domain sustains discrimination to K*=3, meaning depth-2 \n      and depth-3 texts are statistically distinguishable — but this distinguishability \n      does not translate to differential value for language model training.\"\n      这个 reframing 实际上增加了 K* 概念的信息论深度——K* 是 information-theoretic \n      measurement，不是 utility metric。在 median 档下，一位审稿人会认为这是 \n      \"more honest and nuanced\" framing，另一位会用它来论证 practical impact 不足。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49625,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49625},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c64fd865-c94f-47e2-9b7a-d5cf3b7b556f","uuid":"71223c62-f0d7-4327-b581-9d419998d605"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":154057,"duration_api_ms":156133,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档下，C1' 域阶梯核心（Wiki=1, C4=2, arXiv=3）成立但 Qwen-cont 边缘性和 θ 依赖性被审稿人重点追问。\n  C3 从 \"K*-aware filtering outperforms\" 降级为 \"binary filtering suffices for web text; graduated filtering \n  provides no incremental benefit, suggesting K* captures discriminability rather than curation-relevant quality \n  differences\"。两个 planned 实验（exp-014, exp-028）提供补充证据但不改变核心叙事。\n  exp-014 的 naturalistic validation 展示 lab-to-wild 迁移存在但偏弱，审稿人认为是 interesting preliminary \n  而非 convincing validation。exp-028 的 power curve 确认 n=5000 足够但暴露 n<3000 时边缘配置不稳定，\n  被用于 rebuttal 中论证现有样本量充足。what_if 的 arXiv negative 整合被一位审稿人认可科学诚实，\n  但另一位用它论证 C3 的 practical value 不足。总体 ARR 3.0-3.5，Findings 概率 0.65-0.85。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic CC Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-09/2026-01 snapshot 各抽 50K 文档，用训练好的 OBD-LightGBM \n      预测 depth distribution，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, \n      hapax legomena ratio)、重复率 (self-BLEU) 做 Spearman correlation。\n      额外分析：按预测 depth 分层后各质量指标的分布变化。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_per_snapshot: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0_pct: 62.3\n        depth_1_pct: 24.7\n        depth_2_pct: 8.4\n        depth_3plus_pct: 4.6\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.28\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.22\n      spearman_rho_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.19\n      spearman_rho_hapax_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_selfbleu_vs_predicted_depth: 0.16\n      spearman_rho_selfbleu_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_stratified_alignscore_mean:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.65\n        depth_2: 0.58\n        depth_3plus: 0.51\n      depth_stratified_ttr_mean:\n        depth_0: 0.483\n        depth_1: 0.451\n        depth_2: 0.422\n        depth_3plus: 0.398\n      snapshot_temporal_shift:\n        cc_2025_09_mean_depth: 0.58\n        cc_2026_01_mean_depth: 0.64\n        delta: 0.06\n        p_ks_test: 0.032\n      cross_validation_with_lab_features:\n        feature_rank_spearman_lab_vs_wild: 0.81\n        top3_wild_features: [\"freq_entropy\", \"surp_d1_mean\", \"surp_std\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下，lab-to-wild 迁移部分成功但受限。Spearman ρ~0.22-0.28 统计显著但 practically \n      moderate，原因有三：(1) CC 真实数据包含多种非 prompt-chain 的合成路径（翻译管道、摘要重写、\n      RAG 输出），这些与训练时的 prompt-chain 分布不同；(2) CC 包含大量非英文和低质量原始文本，\n      引入与 depth 无关的噪声；(3) 深度预测在 depth≥2 处 uncertainty 急剧增大（lab 中 2v3 AUC \n      仅 0.55-0.56），导致高 depth 预测噪声大。正向信号来自 depth-stratified quality 单调递减——\n      预测的更深层文本确实质量更低——但效应大小不足以支持 \"operational deployment\" claim。\n      时间维度的 CC 2025→2026 depth 增长（+0.06）与合成文本扩散趋势一致但统计上 borderline。\n      审稿人会认为这是 \"suggestive but not definitive\" 的 preliminary validation，\n      一位审稿人可能要求排除明显的机器翻译文本后重做分析。Feature ranking 在 lab 和 wild 之间 \n      ρ=0.81 说明特征空间迁移合理，但不完美——wild 数据中 freq_entropy 的重要性上升，\n      因为不同合成路径产生不同的词汇分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CC Depth Distribution vs Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Predicted Depth\", \"N docs\", \"AlignScore (mean±std)\", \"TTR (mean±std)\", \"Self-BLEU (mean±std)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"~31K\", \"0.72±0.11\", \"0.483±0.052\", \"0.12±0.04\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"~12K\", \"0.65±0.13\", \"0.451±0.058\", \"0.15±0.05\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"~4K\", \"0.58±0.14\", \"0.422±0.061\", \"0.19±0.06\"]\n          - [\"3+\", \"~2K\", \"0.51±0.16\", \"0.398±0.067\", \"0.23±0.07\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Spearman Correlations (Predicted Depth vs Quality)\"\n        columns: [\"Quality Metric\", \"ρ\", \"p-value\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"AlignScore\", \"-0.28\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.30, -0.26]\"]\n          - [\"Type-Token Ratio\", \"-0.22\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.24, -0.20]\"]\n          - [\"Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.19\", \"<0.001\", \"[-0.21, -0.17]\"]\n          - [\"Self-BLEU\", \"+0.16\", \"<0.001\", \"[+0.14, +0.18]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth (x) vs AlignScore (y), with density contours. 清晰但散布大。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: depth-stratified AlignScore/TTR means with error bars,单调递减趋势可见。\"\n      - \"Histogram: CC 2025-09 vs 2026-01 predicted depth distributions overlay,轻微右移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 提供了方向性证据但不是 decisive。核心限制：我们的 depth \n      predictor 训练于 prompt-chain controlled data，而 wild 合成文本的生成路径多样化且未知。\n      ρ~0.25 的 moderate correlation 足以进入 Discussion 作为 \"promising direction\"，\n      但审稿人不会将其视为强 external validity 证据。Median 档审稿人的典型反应：\n      \"The naturalistic analysis is interesting but the modest correlations (ρ<0.30) \n      raise questions about whether the lab-measured K* translates to actionable \n      web-scale data governance\" — 这成为 major weakness #2 但不致命。\n      建议在论文中定位为 \"preliminary naturalistic analysis\" 而非 \"validation\"，\n      并在 Limitations 中讨论 lab-to-wild gap。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      对 C4 数据（使用 exp-007 的 Qwen-cont 和 Pythia 数据），在 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} \n      各做 10 次 bootstrap resample，每次重新计算 1v2 pairwise AUC 和 K* 判定，\n      绘制 power curve：在各 n 下 K*=2 判定的成功率（即 1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60 的比例）。\n    expected_results:\n      models_tested: [\"Qwen-cont (most marginal)\", \"Pythia-1.4B (moderate margin)\"]\n      resamples_per_n: 10\n      qwen_cont_power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.3\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.610\n          mean_ci_width: 0.038\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.591\n        n_2000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.5\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.027\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.597\n        n_3000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.7\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.022\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.600\n        n_4000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.9\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.019\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.602\n        n_5000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.611\n          mean_ci_width: 0.017\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.603\n      pythia_power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.7\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.653\n          mean_ci_width: 0.035\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.636\n        n_2000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 0.9\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.025\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.641\n        n_3000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.020\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.644\n        n_4000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.018\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.645\n        n_5000:\n          kstar2_success_rate: 1.0\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.654\n          mean_ci_width: 0.016\n          mean_ci_lower: 0.646\n      critical_n_for_95pct_power:\n        qwen_cont: 4500\n        pythia: 2000\n      arXiv_implication:\n        arXiv_n_per_model: 2200\n        arXiv_2v3_effect_size: \"larger (AUC~0.63-0.65)\"\n        arXiv_power_sufficient: true\n        note: \"arXiv 的 2v3 AUC 效应量 (0.63-0.65) 远大于 C4 1v2 (0.61)，n=2200 足够\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 power curve 揭示了已知的 Qwen-cont 边缘性问题的样本量根源。\n      Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅超过 θ=0.60 约 0.011，这意味着 CI lower > θ \n      需要很窄的 CI，即大样本。在 n=1000 时 CI width~0.038，CI lower~0.591 < 0.60，\n      导致 K*=2 判定失败率 70%。n=3000 是转折点（成功率 70%），n≥4500 才达到 95% power。\n      相比之下 Pythia 1v2 AUC=0.6539，margin 大得多，n=2000 即可达 90% power。\n      这为审稿人提供了两个信息：(1) 现有 n=5000 的主实验样本量充分（Qwen-cont 100% 通过），\n      (2) Qwen-cont 的边缘性是效应量问题而非方法论缺陷。\n      arXiv 实验 n=2200 但效应量更大（2v3 AUC 0.63-0.65），power 充足。\n      审稿人可能的反应：承认现有样本量 adequate，但指出 \"the marginal Qwen-cont result \n      suggests that for some model configurations, considerably larger samples would \n      be needed to confidently determine K*\"，这成为 minor weakness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"Qwen-cont Success Rate\", \"Qwen-cont mean CI lower\", \"Pythia Success Rate\", \"Pythia mean CI lower\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"3/10\", \"0.591\", \"7/10\", \"0.636\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"5/10\", \"0.597\", \"9/10\", \"0.641\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"7/10\", \"0.600\", \"10/10\", \"0.644\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"9/10\", \"0.602\", \"10/10\", \"0.645\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.603\", \"10/10\", \"0.646\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve: x=sample size, y=K*=2 detection success rate, 两条线 (Qwen-cont, Pythia)，虚线标 95% power 和对应 critical n。\"\n      - \"CI width vs n: 显示 CI 收窄速度，标注 Qwen-cont 在各 n 下 CI lower 相对 θ=0.60 的位置。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Power curve 的核心价值在于 rebuttal。当审稿人质疑 Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 \n      的 marginal 性时，power curve 提供了量化回应：\"At n=5000, even the most marginal \n      configuration (Qwen-cont, AUC=0.611) achieves 100% K*=2 detection rate. \n      The marginality reflects a genuine small effect size for this particular \n      model in continuation mode, not insufficient evidence.\"\n      同时 power curve 暴露了一个 honest limitation：如果有模型的 1v2 AUC 在 0.600-0.605 \n      范围内（比 Qwen-cont 更边缘），n=5000 可能不够。这在 median 档下被审稿人标记为 \n      minor concern 但可以通过 \"our protocol can be scaled to larger n for \n      borderline cases\" 来回应。\n      Rebuttal 用途：直接回应 θ=0.60 任意性质疑——power analysis 表明在合理的 n 下，\n      θ±0.02 范围内的 K* 判定结果一致（AUC 0.58 的 pair 在任何 n 下都不通过，\n      AUC 0.63+ 的 pair 在 n≥1500 下就通过），证明 θ=0.60 处存在 natural gap。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what-if)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 负向结果整合进论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null \n      result 表格，Discussion 增加 \"K* characterizes discriminability not data utility\" 洞察，\n      Appendix 放完整 15-run paired t-test 表。评估对审稿分数和 credibility 的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      section_5_addition:\n        table_rows: 3\n        table_content: \"no_filter/binary/graduated on arXiv, MMLU and HellaSwag means±std\"\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.94\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: 0.89\n        paired_ttest_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.005\n        paired_ttest_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: \"<0.001\"\n        binary_direction_conflict: \"MMLU -0.23pp vs HellaSwag +0.42pp\"\n      discussion_insight:\n        key_sentence: >\n          K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary of recursive \n          generation, not a utility boundary — text at depth 2-3 is distinguishable \n          from depth 3-4 on arXiv (2v3 AUC=0.64), but this discriminability does not \n          translate to meaningful quality differences for downstream training.\n      reviewer_reactions:\n        reviewer_1_positive: >\n          \"The honest reporting of the arXiv null result (exp-026) is appreciated \n          and strengthens the paper's credibility. The reframing of K* as a \n          discriminability measure rather than a utility measure is insightful.\"\n        reviewer_2_negative: >\n          \"The arXiv filtering result essentially means that K*-aware curation only \n          works on C4 with one model family (Qwen). Combined with exp-025 (Pythia \n          null), the practical value of C3 is limited to a narrow setting.\"\n        reviewer_3_neutral: >\n          \"Honest negative results are expected in scientific practice, not bonus \n          points. The C3 claim should be explicitly conditional on model and domain.\"\n      credibility_delta: \"+0.15 to +0.25 on overall score (partial offset by C3 weakening)\"\n      c3_acceptance_prob_impact: \"-0.10 (from 0.55 to 0.45)\"\n      honest_negative_recognition: \"acknowledged by 2/3 reviewers but not viewed as special merit\"\n      net_paper_impact:\n        arr_score_without_integration: 3.15\n        arr_score_with_integration: 3.25\n        findings_prob_without: 0.70\n        findings_prob_with: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下，诚实报告负向结果是双刃剑。正面：(1) 增加科学可信度——审稿人看到作者不\n      cherry-pick 结果；(2) \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察为 K* 概念提供了更深层理解，从 \n      \"K* predicts optimal curation\" 转为更 nuanced 的 \"K* measures statistical \n      discriminability whose practical implications are domain- and model-dependent\"。\n      负面：(1) C3 的 practical claim 从 \"K*-aware filtering outperforms\" 被迫降级为 \n      \"binary filtering suffices for web text; graduated filtering provides no \n      additional benefit\"——这削弱了论文的 practical impact story；(2) 两个负向 filtering \n      结果（exp-025 Pythia, exp-026 arXiv）加上 exp-006 仅 Qwen-C4 正向结果，让审稿人\n      总结为 \"filtering benefit is model-specific and domain-specific\"；(3) 审稿人认为\n      honest negative 是 expected practice 而非加分项——\"we don't give extra credit \n      for not lying\"。\n      净效应在 median 档下是 slightly positive：credibility gain (+0.1-0.15 on score) \n      略大于 practical claim 损失，因为 C1' 是论文核心且不受影响。Findings 概率从 0.70 \n      提升到 0.78，因为 Findings track 更看重 characterization quality 而非 practical impact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: arXiv Filtering Results (Section 5 addition)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\", \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Binary\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.0023 (p=0.005)\", \"+0.0042 (p<0.001)\"]\n          - [\"Graduated α=0.9\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.0001 (p=0.94)\", \"-0.0001 (p=0.89)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"无新图。现有 Section 5 的 filtering comparison figure 增加 arXiv panel。\"\n    analysis: >\n      整合策略：在 Section 5 增加一段 \"Domain Generalization of Filtering\" 小节，\n      先呈 C4 正向结果（binary > graduated ≈ no-filter），再呈 arXiv null result \n      （graduated ≈ no-filter, binary 有 metric-specific trade-off），最后 Pythia \n      null result（所有策略 indistinguishable）。Discussion 中将 C3 重新定位：\n      \"These results reveal that K* characterizes the boundary of statistical \n      discriminability in recursive generations, not a boundary of training data \n      utility. The arXiv domain sustains discrimination to K*=3, meaning depth-2 \n      and depth-3 texts are statistically distinguishable — but this distinguishability \n      does not translate to differential value for language model training.\"\n      这个 reframing 实际上增加了 K* 概念的信息论深度——K* 是 information-theoretic \n      measurement，不是 utility metric。在 median 档下，一位审稿人会认为这是 \n      \"more honest and nuanced\" framing，另一位会用它来论证 practical impact 不足。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c64fd865-c94f-47e2-9b7a-d5cf3b7b556f","total_cost_usd":0.5480167499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49625,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":7490,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49625,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":7490,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49625,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49625},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":44585,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.04468,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":7490,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49625,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.50333675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"per